 "level_notes": {
  "0": "The Cython compiler is written in Python (Cython/Compiler): a hand-written recursive-descent parser over a Plex lexicon, a tree of Nodes/ExprNodes transformed by a pipeline of visitors, and C code generation in ModuleNode.py/Code.py.",
  "1": "No specification beyond the official Cython documentation (language basics, extension types, interfacing with C/C++); the compiler defines the language. Changes are discussed as CEPs on the GitHub wiki."
 },
